  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sudanese Business and Donor Gathering</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This one-day event will facilitate the discussion with the Sudanese private sector to better understand how they have been affected by the war, how they are coping with its consequences and what their outlook is on the future. In addition, the broader donor community will be invited to explore opportunities for collaboration with the private sector.</narrative>
  </description>
